{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/corner2.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text18.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a captivating grid-based combat system where you lead the Guardians in a battle to reclaim stolen artifacts from enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text19.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically manage a diverse roster of units, each with unique strengths and abilities, from agile scouts to powerful heavy hitters, ensuring every battle feels fresh and dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/units.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text20.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different terrains modify buffs and debuffs, enhancing strategic gameplay and requiring you to adapt your tactics for maximum advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/snowLava.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text21.png?t=1745200306\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a vibrant 2D + 3D art style that combines playful character designs with richly detailed environments, creating an engaging visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/seezor_02.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text17.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a story-driven single-player campaign filled with challenging missions and an intriguing narrative that unfolds as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/sixcharacters.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text16.png?t=1745200306\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own maps using the built-in level editor, allowing for endless creativity and unique gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/CapCut24.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596290?t=1745200306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/d49f0aabac1b980b5616ca96df12dd730617c442/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745200306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/26c477b5407f742018c55b46339e7e59a84384bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745200306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/26c477b5407f742018c55b46339e7e59a84384bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745200306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/corner2.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text18.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a captivating grid-based combat system where you lead the Guardians in a battle to reclaim stolen artifacts from enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text19.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically manage a diverse roster of units, each with unique strengths and abilities, from agile scouts to powerful heavy hitters, ensuring every battle feels fresh and dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/units.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text20.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different terrains modify buffs and debuffs, enhancing strategic gameplay and requiring you to adapt your tactics for maximum advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/snowLava.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text21.png?t=1745200306\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a vibrant 2D + 3D art style that combines playful character designs with richly detailed environments, creating an engaging visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/seezor_02.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text17.png?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a story-driven single-player campaign filled with challenging missions and an intriguing narrative that unfolds as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/sixcharacters.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/text16.png?t=1745200306\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own maps using the built-in level editor, allowing for endless creativity and unique gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/extras/CapCut24.gif?t=1745200306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["GigaQuests","STOIC Ent."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3266580","name":"Apes Warfare"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596290/215a24abb81eeeb71c7bcdf66411bce6072c1e01/header.jpg?t=1745200306","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Apes Warfare Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["GigaQuests"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_